  "id": "handwriting-analysis",
  "term": "handwriting analysis",
  "definition": "Handwriting analysis is the use of changes or deterioration in a person’s handwriting to estimate their cognitive state at the time of writing. In this context, it refers to quantitatively evaluating handwriting to judge whether cognition appears normal or impaired.",
